flowchart LR
  CAP[Business capability] --> RULE[Rule, decision or process]
  RULE --> ADR[ADR: why this option]
  RULE --> ORACLE[Independent oracle case]
  ADR --> ORACLE
  ORACLE --> CAND[Candidate + source digest]
  CAND --> OBS[Recorded observation]
  OBS --> VERDICT{PASS · FAIL · INCONCLUSIVE}
  VERDICT --> APPROVAL[Separate approval G2/G6]
  APPROVAL --> DRIFT[Drift review G7]
  DRIFT -. changes the baseline .-> RULE
